      "content": "preeclampsia?? that sounds scary. you dont think it's serious though right? my doctor is super hard to reach and i dont really want to go to the hospital unless it's a huge emergency because of the cost and everything. the swelling is kinda annoying but the lights are just a little weird, they go away pretty fast. you're pretty sure it's just exhaustion then?",
